  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIRECT AID to Ukrainian Villagers and Soldiers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Krzysztof A from Osweicim Poland has been driving supplies into Ukraine since Putin&apos;s War began.  He goes directly into the small villages dotting the countryside and brings much needed food for People and Pets.  Dr. Oksana is working on the frontline to help save the lives of wounded soldiers.  Both need funds for the medical supplies, food and blankets.  Krzysztof also needs funds for fuel and vehicle  maintenance.  You can support both of these HEROS - you can help SAVE LIVES NOW!</narrative>
  </description>
